# Scholight

> Scholight helps researchers and AI agents find relevant academic papers and retrieve readable source content through REST and a stateless MCP server.

## Documentation

- [Agent documentation](@@SCHOLIGHT_PUBLIC_WEB_URL@@/docs.md): Quick start, authentication, REST search, MCP configuration, search behavior, and error handling.
- [OpenAPI schema](@@SCHOLIGHT_PUBLIC_WEB_URL@@/api/openapi.json): Authoritative machine-readable REST request and response contract.

## Integration

- [MCP endpoint](@@SCHOLIGHT_PUBLIC_WEB_URL@@/api/mcp): Stateless Streamable HTTP endpoint exposing `search_papers` and authenticated `extract_url`.
- [Web Extract endpoint](@@SCHOLIGHT_PUBLIC_WEB_URL@@/api/extract): Access-Key-authenticated URL extraction for HTML, rendered pages, JSON, XML, and PDF.
